{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to have the bragging rights to say &quot;I have a 1 in a million achievement on Steam&quot;? Well today is your lucky day because that is what this entire game is based on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong> Get a score of 1,000,000 all you have to do is click a button and hope it hits the 1,000,000 and you will now have that achievement, you can purchase upgrades that allow for an auto clicker and reduce the time between clicks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also side achievements that can be acquired such as 1% which is a score of 1, Full stop, which is a score of 999,999 and upgraded, which is acquired by purchasing all upgrades, if you get those 4 plus the 1 million, then you will have the King of Achievements achievement which is by far the rarest of rare when it comes to achievements, this game can take years to 100% or it could take a single day, it's all based on odds, you might get very lucky your first couple clicks</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One In a Million","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943970/d83edb940201c5870e1d07cb12b3e85ac3291d05.jpg"},{"name":"1%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943970/f00b660af2cacada53076bd3822d9000a93c1b4d.jpg"},{"name":"Upgraded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943970/ae152d0e167cbba12ac9e985d0116b61fd1e154a.jpg"},{"name":"Full Stop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943970/2dce9e10a2d7e060433a659268f757db92a2eed3.jpg"},{"name":"King of Achievements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943970/35e15c3d2ded93e5d54b4012b2c81c23e127f7fe.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943970?t=17563